          "quote_count": 2,
          "reply_count": 28,
          "retweet_count": 6
        },
        "text": "So the new trend is companies selling 'AI Factories'\n\nI don't think this works.\n\nEvery company is special.\nGuess who knows it the best? That's right, those who run the company 😂\n\nDon't let someone sell you a factory. Build your own."
