                "start": 29,
                "username": "Grok"
              }
            ]
          },
          "text": "The \"Add to chat\" feature in @Grok Bot is one of the best quality of life features in a chat I have ever seen/used. \n\nIt's so useful that I find myself trying to use it on Copilot (work 🙄).\n\nIf you didn't know, select any part of your bot's reply and either press \"Ctrl+L\" or hover over the selection and you'll see \"Add to chat\" appear right above it! \n\nHappy Groking 🤭🫶"
        },
